      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afbb",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5146,
      "bookHadithIndex": 107,
      "text": "Ali said:\"The Prophet of Allah [SAW] took hold of some silk in his right hand, and some gold in his left, then he said: 'These two are forbidden for the males of my Ummah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5146-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5146-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5146-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afbc",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5147,
      "bookHadithIndex": 108,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Abdullah bin Zurair Al-Ghafiqi said:\"I heard 'Ali say: 'The Messenger of Allah [SAW] took some gold in his right hand and some silk in his left hand and said: This is forbidden for the males of my Ummah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5147-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5147-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5147-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afbd",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5148,
      "bookHadithIndex": 109,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Musa that :The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: \"Gold and silk have been permitted for the females of my Ummah, and forbidden to the males",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5148-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5148-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5148-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afbe",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5149,
      "bookHadithIndex": 110,
      "text": "It was narrated from Mu'awiyah that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade wearing silk and gold, unless it was broken (into smaller pieces)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5149-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5149-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5149-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afbf",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5150,
      "bookHadithIndex": 111,
      "text": "It was narrated from Mu'awiyah that :The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade wearing gold unless it was broken (into smaller pieces), and (he forbade) riding on Al-Mayathir",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5150-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5150-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5150-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afc0",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5151,
      "bookHadithIndex": 112,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Shaikh that he heard Mu'awiyah say,:When a group of the Companions of Muhammad [SAW] were with him: \"Do you know that the Prophet of Allah [SAW] forbade wearing gold unless it was broken (into smaller pieces)?\" They said: \"By Allah, yes",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5151-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5151-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5151-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afc1",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5152,
      "bookHadithIndex": 113,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Shaikh said:\"While we were with Mu'awiyah on one of his pilgrimages, he gathered together a group of the Companions of Muhammad [SAW] and said to them: 'Do you not know that the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade wearing gold unless it was broken (into smaller pieces)?' They said: 'By Allah, yes",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5152-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5152-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5152-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afc2",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5153,
      "bookHadithIndex": 114,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Himman:That when Mu'awiyah went on Hajj, he gathered together a group of the Companions of the Messenger of Allah [SAW] at the Ka'bah and said to them: \"I adjure you by Allah, did the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbid wearing gold?\" They said: \"Yes.\" He said: \"And I bear witness to that",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5153-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5153-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5153-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afc3",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5154,
      "bookHadithIndex": 115,
      "text": "Abu Shaikh narrated from his brother Himman:That when Mu'awiyah went on Hajj, he gathered together a group of the Companions of the Messenger of Allah [SAW] at the Ka'bah and said to them: \"I adjure you by Allah, did the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbid wearing gold?\" They said: \"Yes.\" He said: \"And I bear witness to that",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5154-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5154-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5154-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afc4",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5155,
      "bookHadithIndex": 116,
      "text": "Himman said:\"Mu'awiyah went on Hajj and he called a group of Ansar to the Ka'bah. He said: 'I adjure you by Allah, did you hear the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbid gold?' They said: 'Yes.' He said: 'And I bear witness to that",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5155-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5155-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5155-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afc5",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5156,
      "bookHadithIndex": 117,
