      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afc7",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5158,
      "bookHadithIndex": 119,
      "text": "Himman said:\"Mu'awiyah went on Hajj and he called a group of Ansar to the Ka'bah. He said: 'I adjure you by Allah, did you hear the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbid gold?' They said: 'Yes.' He said: 'And I bear witness to that",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5158-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5158-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5158-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afc8",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5159,
      "bookHadithIndex": 120,
      "text": "Abu Shaikh Al-Huna'i said:\"I heard Mu'awiyah say to a group of Muhajirun and Ansar who were around him: 'Do you know that the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade wearing silk?' They said: 'By Allah, yes.' He said 'And (he forbade) wearing gold unless it was broken (into smaller pieces)?' They said: 'Yes.'\" 'Ali bin Ghurab contradicted him; he reported it from Bahais, from Abu Shaikh, from Ibn 'Umar",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5159-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5159-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5159-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afc9",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5160,
      "bookHadithIndex": 121,
      "text": "Abu Shaikh said:\"I heard Ibn 'Umar say: 'The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade wearing gold unless it is broken (into smaller pieces)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5160-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5160-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5160-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afca",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5161,
      "bookHadithIndex": 122,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Arafah bin As'ad that:His nose was cut off at the battle of Al-Kulab during the Jahiliyyah, so he wore a nose made of silver, but it began to rot, so the Prophet [SAW] told him to wear a nose made of gold",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5161-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5161-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5161-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afcb",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5162,
      "bookHadithIndex": 123,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Abdur-Rahman bin Tarafah, from 'Arafah bin As'ad bin Karib, who was his grandfather- saying that he saw his grandfather, and he said:\"His nose had been cut off at the battle of Al-Kulab during the Jahiliyyah, so he wore a nose made of silver, but it began to rot on him, so the Prophet [SAW] told him to wear a nose made of gold",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5162-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5162-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5162-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afcc",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5163,
      "bookHadithIndex": 124,
      "text": "It was narrated that Sa'eed bin Al-Musayyab said:\"Umar said to Suhaib: 'Why do I see you wearing a ring of gold?' He said: 'One who was better than you saw it and did not criticize it.' He said: 'Who was that?' He said: 'The Messenger of Allah [SAW]",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5163-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5163-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5163-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afcd",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5164,
      "bookHadithIndex": 125,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Umar said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] started to wear a gold ring, and the people started to wear gold rings. The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'I was wearing this ring, but I will never wear it again.' He threw it away and the people threw their rings away",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5164-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5164-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5164-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afce",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5165,
      "bookHadithIndex": 126,
      "text": "Ali said:\"The Prophet [SAW] forbade me to wear gold rings and Al-Qassi, red Al-Miyathir, and (to drink) Al-Ji'ah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5165-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5165-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5165-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afcf",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5166,
      "bookHadithIndex": 127,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Ali said:\"The Prophet [SAW] forbade me to wear gold rings, and Al-Qassi, red Al-Miyathir",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5166-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5166-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5166-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afd0",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5167,
      "bookHadithIndex": 128,
      "text": "Ali said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade gold rings, red Al-Miyathir, Qassiyah garments and Al-Ji'ah, which is a drink made from barley and wheat.\" - And he mentioned its strength",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5167-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5167-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5167-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afd1",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5168,
      "bookHadithIndex": 129,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Ali said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade me (to wear) gold rings and Al-Qassi, Al-Mitharah, and Al-Ji'ah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5168-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5168-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5168-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afd2",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5169,
      "bookHadithIndex": 130,
      "text": "It was narrated that Sa'sa'ah bin Suwhan said:\"I said to 'Ali: 'Forbid to us that which the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade to you.' He said: 'He forbade me from Ad-Dubba', Al-Hantam, gold circles (rings), wearing silk, and Al-Qassi, and red Al-Mitharah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5169-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5169-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5169-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afd3",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5170,
      "bookHadithIndex": 131,
      "text": "It was narrated that Malik bin 'Umair said:\"Sa'sa'ah bin Suwhan came to 'Ali and said: 'Forbid to us from that which the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade to you.' He said: 'He forbade us from Ad-Dubba', Al-Hantam, An-Naqir, Al-Ji'ah, and he forbade us from gold circles (rings), wearing silk, and wearing Al-Qassi, and red Al-Mitharah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5170-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5170-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5170-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afd4",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5171,
      "bookHadithIndex": 132,
      "text": "Sa'sa'ah bin Suwhan said to 'Ali:\"O Commander of the Believers! Forbid us from that which the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade you from.\" He said: \"He forbade us from Ad-Dubba, Al-Hantam, Al-Ji'ah, and from gold circles (rings), and from wearing silk, and from red Al-Mitharah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5171-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5171-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5171-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afd5",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5172,
      "bookHadithIndex": 133,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Ali said:\"My beloved, the Messenger of Allah [SAW], forbade me three things but I do not say that he forbade them to the people. He forbade me from wearing rings of gold, from wearing Al-Qassi, and Al-Mu'asfar Al-Mufaddam (garments that are deeply dyed with safflower), and (he forbade me) from reciting Qur'an when prostrating or bowing.\" He was followed (in that narration) by Ad-Dahhak bin 'Uthman",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5172-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5172-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5172-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afd6",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5173,
      "bookHadithIndex": 134,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Ali said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade me- but I do not say that he forbade you- from wearing rings of gold, and from wearing Al-Qassi, and from wearing Al-Mufaddam (garments dyed deep red) and Al-Mu'asfar (garments dyed with safflower), and from reciting Qur'an while bowing",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5173-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5173-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5173-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afd7",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5174,
      "bookHadithIndex": 135,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibrahim that his father told him that he heard 'Ali say:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade me to recite Qur'an while bowing and to wear gold and garments dyed with safflower",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5174-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5174-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5174-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afd8",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5175,
      "bookHadithIndex": 136,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibrahim bin 'Abdullah bin Hunain that his father said:\"I heard 'Ali say: 'The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade me- but I do not say that he forbade you- from wearing gold rings, Al-Qassi, and garments dyed with safflower, and reciting Qur'an while bowing",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5175-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5175-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5175-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afd9",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5176,
      "bookHadithIndex": 137,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Ali said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade me from rings of gold, garments dyed with safflower, and wearing Al-Qassi, and from reciting Qur'an while bowing",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5176-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5176-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5176-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afda",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5177,
      "bookHadithIndex": 138,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn Hunain- the freed slave of Ibn 'Abbas- that 'Ali said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade me from wearing Al-Qassi, garments dyed with safflower, and gold rings",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5177-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5177-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5177-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afdb",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5178,
      "bookHadithIndex": 139,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn Hunain, the freed slave of 'Ali, that 'Ali said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade me from four: Gold rings, wearing Al-Qassi, reciting Qur'an while I am bowing, and from wearing garments dyed with safflower",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5178-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5178-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5178-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afdc",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5179,
      "bookHadithIndex": 140,
      "text": "It was narrated from Nafi', from a freed slave of Ibn 'Abbas, that 'Ali said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade me from wearing garments dyed with safflower, and from Al-Qassi, and from gold rings, and that I recite Qur'an while I am bowing",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5179-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5179-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5179-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afdd",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5180,
      "bookHadithIndex": 141,
      "text": "Ibn Hunain narrated that 'Ali said to him:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade me (from wearing) garments dyed with safflower, and from gold rings, and from wearing Al-Qassi, and that I recite Qur'an while I am bowing",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5180-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5180-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5180-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afde",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5181,
      "bookHadithIndex": 142,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Ali that :The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade (wearing) garments dyed with safflower, and Al-Qassiyah garments, and reciting Qur'an while he is bowing",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5181-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5181-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5181-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
