          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afe0",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5183,
      "bookHadithIndex": 144,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Ali said:\"The Prophet [SAW] forbade me from Al-Qassi, silk, gold rings, and that I recite Qur'an while bowing.\" Hisham contradicted him, he did not narrate it in Marfu' form",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5183-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5183-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5183-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0afe1",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 48,
      "hadithIndex": 5184,
      "bookHadithIndex": 145,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Abidah, from 'Ali, he said:\"He forbade red Al-Mayathir, wearing Al-Qassi, and gold rings",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-48-5184-abughuddah",
